  Goal: empty app builds and runs on Windows, Android, Chrome with a working local DB.
  ✔ P0-01 flutter create with android, ios, web, windows @S @done(2026-08-31)
    flutter create . --project-name myhealthcare --org bh.edu.uob --platforms android,ios,web,windows
    Windows debug build verified (myhealthcare.exe built, exit 0). flutter analyze clean.
    Committed 8882cb6.
  ✔ P0-02 App display name "MyHealth Care", app icons @S @done(2026-08-31)
    Bundle id bh.edu.uob.myhealthcare already set at create time — left unchanged.
    Display name "MyHealth Care" set on Android (manifest label), iOS (CFBundleDisplayName
    + CFBundleName), Web (index.html title + manifest name/short_name), Windows
    (window title + Runner.rc ProductName/FileDescription). Binary name stays myhealthcare.
    Icon: original teal (#00696E) medical-cross + ECG-pulse mark, master art in
    assets/icon/, generated for all 4 platforms via flutter_launcher_icons
    (config: flutter_launcher_icons.yaml). Android adaptive icon = teal bg + white
    foreground. Windows debug build verified, exe ProductName "MyHealth Care".
    flutter analyze clean.
  ✔ P0-03 Add all dependencies to pubspec.yaml @M @done(2026-08-31)
    All packages from plan.md added; flutter pub get clean, analyze clean,
    Windows debug build verified.
    TOOLCHAIN CONSTRAINT (Dart 3.12.2 / Flutter 3.44.4): freezed 4.x needs Dart
    >= 3.13, and drift_dev >= 2.34.1 / riverpod_generator 4.x need analyzer 13,
    which freezed 3.x (analyzer <= 11) cannot share. Resolution:
      - Riverpod 2.6.1 with HAND-WRITTEN providers — no riverpod_generator,
        no @riverpod codegen. (Most-documented Riverpod version; simpler build.)
      - drift pinned ^2.34.0, drift_dev pinned '>=2.34.0 <2.34.1' (pre-analyzer-13).
      - freezed ^3.1.0 (still used for entity codegen — that's the important one).
      - riverpod_lint + custom_lint dropped (ecosystem lag vs analyzer).
    Revisit the whole set if Flutter is upgraded to a Dart >= 3.13 release.
